===Etymology===
{{bor+|id|nl|abortus}}, from {{der|id|la|abortus}}, perfect active participle from {{m|la|aborior|t=pass away; miscarry}}, from {{m|la|ab||from, away from}} + {{m|la|orior||rise, get up; appear}}. {{doublet|id|aborsi}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|id|/ˈabɔrt̪ʊs/}}
* {{hyphenation|id|abor|tus}}

===Noun===
{{id-noun}}

# {{lb|id|obstetrics}} {{l|en|abortus}}; [[abortion]]: the expulsion from the womb of a foetus or embryo before it is fully developed, with loss of the foetus; either naturally as a spontaneous abortion (now usually called a [[miscarriage]]), or deliberately as an induced abortion (see {{cog|id|aborsi}})

